          "Visible": true,
          "Text": "Cylinder Teeth: [TEETH] T\nStandard Pitch: [PITCH_UM] um (1/8\" Circular Pitch)\nRepeat Circumference: [REPEAT_MM] mm ([REPEAT_INCH] inches)\nTotal Run Metres: [TOTAL_RUN_METRES] m\nRack / Location: [STORAGE_LOCATION]\nStorage Rack: [STORAGE_RACK]\nStorage Shelf: [STORAGE_SHELF]\nStorage Bin: [STORAGE_BIN]",
